# Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/eiliad.
# eiliad (masculine/feminine), plural eiliadau.  Opens on a vowel,
# so no mutation reaches it.
# A Welsh numeral is followed by the singular (or, for the year, its count
# form), so both the counted forms and the ordinary plural are surfaces of
# this unit.
eiliad
eiliadau
